  "description": "It's been three years since Weon met Toram at his restaurant and they hit it off as friends. Despite his bad luck in love, Weon always has Toram's sympathetic ear and tasty fried shrimp to cheer him up. However, their friendship is threatened when Weon discovers Toram is a divine snail masquerading as a human! Once the divine world finds out Toram got caught by a human, he'll be demoted to a regular snail and Weon will never see him again... unless he helps Toram earn enough good karma to offset his punishment in just two weeks!\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
